    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the professional stuff doesn't change the reality though. i have no community, no influence, no platform. it's like my entire identity was tied to that digital space and since that's been wiped, there's just nothing left of me. i'm just a shell. what's even the point of being here if the person i actually was is dead?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
